el6751 can master process data handling module

1. module configuration

config:
    ec_module: ethercat                     # module name of soem ethercat master
    ec_slave_id: 12                         # slave_id of el6751
    slave_modules: [ module_1, module_2 ]   # names of can slave modules packets 
                                            # will be sent to/received from
depends: [ ethercat, module_1, module_2 ]   # put all modules on depend list

2. process data for lnrk

el6751 has no process data via lnrk

